G2 from the equations: Foot scale a_F = G K^2/M (K = lambda R_SN normalisation; lambda from dark photoionisation and cooling cross sections, SN spectrum); FKP scale C a0 (cross-section normalisation, Eq. 4.1). rho_DE, Lambda, H appear in neither; native slope 0 [FAIL]. a0 = cH0/6 in FKP is an estimate, not derived.
G5: both are halo gravity at measured radii, pass by definition. Cassini: not graded (equilibrium on Solar System scales not stated in either source).

